    "Feeling" : {

    },
    "Feeling unwell? Mark “I'm unwell today” on the Today card, on Home. Scoring goes gentle for that day only: workouts stop counting against you, rest, water and personal care count for a little more, your water target nudges up, and your companion rests. It clears itself tomorrow." : {

    },
    "Fernlet" : {

    },
    "Fernlet asks at first use where practical, so you can start without granting everything now." : {

    },
    "Fernlet asks for Health access only when a feature needs it." : {

    },
    "Fernlet can also delete the entries it wrote to Apple Health — that's the second button below. It can only ever delete its own; everything else in Apple Health is yours to delete in the Health app." : {

    },
    "Fernlet can search the web for chain and packaged-food nutrition. Your meal description is sent to a search provider only when this is on." : {

    },
    "Fernlet can't undo this." : {

    },
    "Fernlet companion" : {

    },
    "Fernlet couldn't check your age with Apple, so this is your word for it. Only confirm if you really are %lld or older — %@ is meant for people that age and up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Fernlet couldn't check your age with Apple, so this is your word for it. Only confirm if you really are %1$lld or older — %2$@ is meant for people that age and up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
